        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il se cache sans bouger au fond de sa grotte, sans eau ni nourriture. Les raisons de sa survie sont, à franchement parler, un véritable mystère.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "They lurk deep within caves—motionless, neither eating nor drinking. Why they don’t die is not known.",
